        "created_at": "2022-04-18T13:06:13.638Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I really hate that kind of thing. I find rules like that needlessly restrictive and completely against the spirit of cooperation in gameplay. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/confused.png?v=12\" title=\":confused:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":confused:\"> I even ignore them in actual game rules, nevermind extra scenarios.</p>",
