        "created_at": "2022-04-19T13:31:15.596Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Spirit Island Saturday is a regular show on our Handelabra Games Twitch channel, here: <a href=\"https://twitch.tv/handelabragames\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Twitch</a></p>\n<p>It’s every Saturday at 2 pm Eastern time, with a rotating cast of players. The main regulars are myself (lead developer at Handelabra Games), LogicDolphin (who also streams for us on Mondays), and Seamus (who also streams for us on Fridays). We often have <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/jffdougan\">@jffdougan</a> on as well, and various special guests.</p>\n<p>You can check out the archive on YouTube here: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLGPBmjNUB43jHzGOPJLHsQ9F7AkF3SNKh\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLGPBmjNUB43jHzGOPJLHsQ9F7AkF3SNKh</a></p>",
